  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "HL extends vectors to three dimensions, covering lines and planes in space, the cross product, and intersection problems — foundational for physics and engineering.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● 3D vectors",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\[\\mathbf{v}=\\begin{pmatrix}v_1\\\\v_2\\\\v_3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{v_1^2+v_2^2+v_3^2},\\quad\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}=u_1v_1+u_2v_2+u_3v_3.\\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Cross product",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\[\\mathbf{u}\\times\\mathbf{v}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\mathbf{i}&\\mathbf{j}&\\mathbf{k}\\\\u_1&u_2&u_3\\\\v_1&v_2&v_3\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}u_2v_3-u_3v_2\\\\u_3v_1-u_1v_3\\\\u_1v_2-u_2v_1\\end{pmatrix}.\\]<p>\\(\\mathbf{u}\\times\\mathbf{v}\\) is perpendicular to both \\(\\mathbf{u}\\) and \\(\\mathbf{v}.\\quad|\\mathbf{u}\\times\\mathbf{v}|=|\\mathbf{u}||\\mathbf{v}|\\sin\\theta=\\) area of parallelogram.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Lines and planes in 3D",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p><strong>Line:</strong> \\(\\mathbf{r}=\\mathbf{a}+t\\mathbf{d}.\\) Parametric: \\(x=a_1+td_1,\\;y=a_2+td_2,\\;z=a_3+td_3.\\)</p><p><strong>Plane:</strong> \\(\\mathbf{r}\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf{n}}=d,\\) or \\(ax+by+cz=d,\\) where \\(\\mathbf{n}=\\langle a,b,c\\rangle\\) is the normal vector.</p><p><strong>Angle between planes:</strong> \\(\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{|\\mathbf{n}_1\\cdot\\mathbf{n}_2|}{|\\mathbf{n}_1||\\mathbf{n}_2|}.\\)</p><p><strong>Distance from point \\(P\\) to plane \\(ax+by+cz=d\\):</strong> \\(\\dfrac{|aP_x+bP_y+cP_z-d|}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}}.\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 3.1 — Cross product",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Find \\(\\mathbf{u}\\times\\mathbf{v}\\) for \\(\\mathbf{u}=\\langle1,2,3\\rangle,\\;\\mathbf{v}=\\langle4,-1,2\\rangle.\\)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>\\(\\mathbf{u}\\times\\mathbf{v}=\\begin{pmatrix}2(2)-3(-1)\\\\3(4)-1(2)\\\\1(-1)-2(4)\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4+3\\\\12-2\\\\-1-8\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\10\\\\-9\\end{pmatrix}.\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · The cross product, in 3D",
          "ar": null
        },
        "canvas3d": {
          "btnId": "ibhlCrossBtn",
          "wrapId": "ibhlCrossWrap",
          "hintId": "ibhlCrossHint",
          "btnLabel": "🧊 View u × v in 3D",
          "ariaLabel": {
            "en": "Interactive 3D plot of vectors u, v, and their cross product w, drawn as arrows from the origin. Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom.",
            "ar": null
          },
          "btnStyle": "margin-top:0"
        },
        "dataPanel": {
          "btnId": "ibhlCrossDataBtn",
          "panelId": "ibhlCrossDataPanel",
          "descId": "ibhlCrossDataDesc",
          "rowsId": "ibhlCrossDataRows",
          "caption": {
            "en": "The two vectors and their cross product",
            "ar": null
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "en": "vector",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "⟨x, y, z⟩",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "magnitude",
              "ar": null
            }
          ]
        },
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "ibhlV3",
            "label": {
              "en": "<b>v</b>'s third component: ",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -50,
            "max": 50,
            "value": 20,
            "step": 5,
            "valueDisplayId": "ibhlV3lab",
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "v3",
              "ar": null
