              "ar": null
            },
            "value": "⟨7, 10, -9⟩",
            "colorClass": "indigo"
          },
          {
            "id": "ibhlWmag",
            "label": {
              "en": "|u × v|",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": "15.166",
            "colorClass": "amber"
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "\\(\\mathbf u=\\langle1,2,3\\rangle\\) fixed (blue), \\(\\mathbf v=\\langle4,-1,v_3\\rangle\\) (amber). \\(\\mathbf u\\times\\mathbf v\\) (green) always stays perpendicular to both.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 3.2 — Intersection of planes",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Find the line of intersection of planes \\(\\pi_1:x+2y-z=3\\) and \\(\\pi_2:2x-y+3z=1.\\)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>Direction of line: \\(\\mathbf{n}_1\\times\\mathbf{n}_2=\\langle1,2,-1\\rangle\\times\\langle2,-1,3\\rangle=\\langle6-1,-3-2,-1-4\\rangle=\\langle5,-5,-5\\rangle\\propto\\langle1,-1,-1\\rangle.\\)</p><p>Find a point: set \\(z=0\\): \\(x+2y=3,\\;2x-y=1\\). Solve: \\(x=1,y=1.\\) Point \\((1,1,0).\\)</p><p>Line: \\(\\mathbf{r}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}+t\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}.\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Line in 3D",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\mathbf{r}=\\mathbf{a}+t\\mathbf{d} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Plane equation",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\mathbf{r}\\cdot\\mathbf{n}=\\mathbf{a}\\cdot\\mathbf{n} \\) or \\( ax+by+cz=d \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the equation of the plane through \\(A(1,2,3)\\), \\(B(4,0,1)\\), \\(C(2,3,0)\\).</p><details style=\"margin-top:8px\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:600\">Show solution</summary><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><p>\\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\langle3,-2,-2\\rangle,\\;\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\langle1,1,-3\\rangle.\\)</p><p>\\(\\mathbf{n}=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\langle8,7,5\\rangle.\\)</p><p>Plane: \\(8(x-1)+7(y-2)+5(z-3)=0\\Rightarrow 8x+7y+5z=37.\\)</p></div></details>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example-grid",
        "label": {
          "en": "Angle between two planes",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the angle between planes \\(\\pi_1: 2x-y+2z=5\\) and \\(\\pi_2: x+2y-2z=3\\).</p><p><strong>Solution:</strong> \\(\\mathbf{n}_1=(2,-1,2)\\), \\(\\mathbf{n}_2=(1,2,-2)\\).</p><p>\\(\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{|\\mathbf{n}_1\\cdot\\mathbf{n}_2|}{|\\mathbf{n}_1||\\mathbf{n}_2|}=\\dfrac{|2-2-4|}{3\\cdot3}=\\dfrac{4}{9}\\implies\\theta\\approx63.6°\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example-grid",
        "label": {
          "en": "Line–plane intersection",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Line: \\(\\mathbf{r}=(1,0,2)+t(1,1,-1)\\). Plane: \\(x+2y+z=4\\). Find the intersection.</p><p><strong>Solution:</strong> Substitute: \\((1+t)+2t+(2-t)=4\\implies 2t+3=4\\implies t=\\frac{1}{2}\\).</p><p>Point: \\(\\left(\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "<strong>Practice:</strong> Find the distance from point \\(P(3,1,-2)\\) to plane \\(2x-2y+z=5\\).",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "\\(d=\\dfrac{|2(3)-2(1)+(-2)-5|}{\\sqrt{4+4+1}}=\\dfrac{|6-2-2-5|}{3}=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\)",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
